    m_Localized: Arrow Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709082423296
    m_Localized: Fires an arrow at the nearest enemy. Leveling up adds arrows and
      pierce
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811910
    m_Localized: Draw the string and the sky goes dark
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811912
    m_Localized: That rain does not know how to stop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811922
    m_Localized: All in One Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811923
    m_Localized: Follow-up Arrows
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811924
    m_Localized: Darkening Sky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811925
    m_Localized: Rain Without End
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811927
    m_Localized: Summons a whirlwind that hunts enemies on its own (lasts 4s). Deals
      damage over time on contact and slows while it damages
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811928
