    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811974
    m_Localized: Lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811975
    m_Localized: For 6 seconds, every enemy that takes attack damage has a 30% chance
      to be struck by lightning
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811976
    m_Localized: The clouds are slow to clear
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811978
    m_Localized: The more it gathers, the less you can handle
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811982
    m_Localized: The storm takes a short breath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811984
    m_Localized: The rod pulls the sky down longer and wider
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811994
    m_Localized: Clouds That Linger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811995
    m_Localized: Fiercer as It Gathers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811996
    m_Localized: Short Breath
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811997
    m_Localized: Pulls the Sky Down
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811998
    m_Localized: Eagle Drop
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090811999
    m_Localized: Drops eagles across the whole screen twice, one second apart, damaging
      every enemy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 709090812006
    m_Localized: Fewer, but far more often
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
